[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 17760.628, "timestamp": "04:56:00", "text": "这就像是根据你想如何看待事物来决定的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17763.91, "timestamp": "04:56:03", "text": "它。 Jo 可以是男性，或者 jaw 可以是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17766.39, "timestamp": "04:56:06", "text": "女性也好，随便吧，因为这跟性别有关。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17768.31, "timestamp": "04:56:08", "text": "中立的东西，对吧？所以，我当时就想："}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17772.788, "timestamp": "04:56:12", "text": "目标是实现这个目标。是的，我得到了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17776.15, "timestamp": "04:56:16", "text": "模特，我一直都是，我以前常常问什么时候"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17780.788, "timestamp": "04:56:20", "text": "索具搭建的预算是多少？嗯"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17783.67, "timestamp": "04:56:23", "text": "呃，预算是多少？就像因为我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17786.07, "timestamp": "04:56:26", "text": "现在需要找一个符合条件的人"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17788.47, "timestamp": "04:56:28", "text": "他们的预算，以便他们可以委托和"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17792.628, "timestamp": "04:56:32", "text": "一切，是的，所以"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17795.59, "timestamp": "04:56:35", "text": "他们说要等等，事情正在发生。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17798.55, "timestamp": "04:56:38", "text": "等等，所以我一直等到二月份。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17801.35, "timestamp": "04:56:41", "text": "今年，我鼓起勇气……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17805.67, "timestamp": "04:56:45", "text": "鼓起勇气问，他们却说“不，呃”。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17807.51, "timestamp": "04:56:47", "text": "事情进展不顺利，我们想"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17810.948, "timestamp": "04:56:50", "text": "专注于我们的主要工作。所以我就想，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17814.39, "timestamp": "04:56:54", "text": "“我的天哪，我该怎么办？”呃，它"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17817.19, "timestamp": "04:56:57", "text": "现在这样做会很无礼。或许是因为我是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17819.83, "timestamp": "04:56:59", "text": "情感型，也许我想到了它"}]